   "size": "MEDIUM"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>Afternoon</b>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "image",
   "url": "https://www.lufthansa.com/content/dam/lh/article-images/mobile-app/africa/perfect-day-cape-town/lh_app_capetown_beach_getty671269788_1920x1080.jpg.transform/lh-dcep-transform-width-1440/img.jpg",
   "contentDescription": "A white sandy beach with turquoise water"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>Scenic Drive Along the Atlantic Coast</b>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<ul><li>The route via Camps Bay and Chapman's Peak Drive is one of the world's most spectacular coastal roads</li><li>My tip: stop at Noordhoek Beach and enjoy the endless stretch of sand</li></ul>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "Noordhoek Beach, Beach Rd, Noordhoek",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "image",
   "url": "https://www.lufthansa.com/content/dam/lh/article-images/mobile-app/africa/perfect-day-cape-town/lh_app_capetown_vineyards_getty1292647913_1920x1080.jpg.transform/lh-dcep-transform-width-1440/img.jpg",
   "contentDescription": "Vines in the South African landscape"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>Wine tasting at Buitenverwachting</b>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<ul><li>A visit to the Buitenverwachting wine estate in the Constantia Valley is a must whenever I'm in Cape Town</li><li>The exceptional wines more than live up to the estate's name, which means \"beyond expectation\"</li></ul>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "Buitenverwachting, Klein Constantia Rd, Constantia",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>Evening</b>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "image",
   "url": "https://www.lufthansa.com/content/dam/lh/article-images/mobile-app/africa/perfect-day-cape-town/lh_app_capetown_beach_getty1202000618_1920x1080.jpg.transform/lh-dcep-transform-width-1440/img.jpg",
   "contentDescription": "Sunset at Glen Beach with the Twelve Apostles mountain range in the background"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>Sunset at Glen Beach</b>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<ul><li>I love watching the sunset from the peaceful Glen Beach</li><li>It's the perfect place to unwind at the end of the day</li></ul>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "Glen Beach, Glen Beach, Camps Bay",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>Dinner at Butcher Shop &amp; Grill</b>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "image",
   "url": "https://www.lufthansa.com/content/dam/lh/article-images/mobile-app/africa/perfect-day-cape-town/lh_app_capetown_steak_butcher-shop-and-grill_1920x1080.jpg.transform/lh-dcep-transform-width-1440/img.jpg",
   "contentDescription": "Close-up of a plate with a steak"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<ul><li>I end the day with a South African steak at Butcher Shop &amp; Grill</li><li>My tip: order your steak no more than medium for the best flavor and texture</li></ul>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "Butcher Shop &amp; Grill, 125 Beach Rd, Mouille Point",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "Copyrights:&nbsp;Imago, Kanéla Café, Getty Images (3), Butcher Shop &amp; Grill",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>About</b>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "Purser Till Nawrath has been working for Lufthansa since 2016. He loves spending his free time abroad, especially in the Mother City: Cape Town.",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
